    },
    {
      "id": "doc-0a2e49f008d25045d6cc75",
      "section": "棋手技能推荐",
      "text": "秘技选择：稳上分推荐选冰封结晶获得兑换券，因为兑换券可以稳定找到海月、杨玉环和姜子牙。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-f4ebbcf48b20979999a3d854f8952e0fb730adc1a84184d9716ac270730cb86c",
          "paragraph_start": 1,
          "paragraph_end": 1
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-11ca47564ffd7a0dcf91f7",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "刚需四件（有没有强度差一个档次）：玉环：大书 + 圣杯；诸葛：变猪；海月：不死鸟。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-f4ebbcf48b20979999a3d854f8952e0fb730adc1a84184d9716ac270730cb86c",
          "paragraph_start": 20,
          "paragraph_end": 20
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-e72f7d93cb4edfe8097a15",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "装备多的话：玉环再补个变猪；诸葛补大书+法穿；海月补御灵之纱+反甲；子牙补名刀+魔律之刃。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-f4ebbcf48b20979999a3d854f8952e0fb730adc1a84184d9716ac270730cb86c",
          "paragraph_start": 21,
          "paragraph_end": 21
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-916435a562906ba6689b11",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "开局拿法：大棒就合成圣剑（影响胜负先拿，否则拿变猪）；破碎圣杯就合成法源之杯；腰带就合不死鸟；守护者之铠合反甲；速击枪合日渊；法典先不选（转大河做回血，75选大书）。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-f4ebbcf48b20979999a3d854f8952e0fb730adc1a84184d9716ac270730cb86c",
          "paragraph_start": 22,
          "paragraph_end": 22
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-324b47b74b4cb0d3b4402a",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "昭君锦囊不多，装备能拿就拿，装备到位战力翻倍。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
